    "summary": "Customer says order Q-7501 (Big Slice Pizza, $46.84) was not received. Delivery events show handoff at 19:02 left at door with photo proof PH-55120 showing bag at door of apt 1204. Customer says she is at her door now and nothing is there. No refund or credit issued."
